{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"papers_group","type":"group","x":-700,"y":650,"width":2560,"height":700,"color":"4","label":"📄 PapersRecap: 核心算法与洞见"},
		{"id":"breakthrough_group","type":"group","x":-700,"y":200,"width":2560,"height":350,"color":"2","label":"⚡ 算法突破点 (Key Technical Challenges)"},
		{"id":"foundations_group","type":"group","x":-700,"y":1450,"width":2900,"height":350,"color":"6","label":"🧠 Foundations: 理论基础"},
		{"id":"proj_dnpm_core","type":"group","x":-200,"y":-400,"width":900,"height":500,"color":"1","label":"🚀 Projects: Dynamic Non-Prehensile Manipulation"},
		{"id":"bt_frequency","type":"text","text":"## 🕐 控制频率困境\n\n**痛点**: 仿真高频 vs 真机低频\n\n**解决思路**:\n- 动作持续时间学习\n- 弹性时间步\n- 惯性阶段自动低频\n- 接触切换自动高频","x":-650,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt_sparse","type":"text","text":"## 🔍 稀疏奖励探索\n\n**痛点**: 长因果链导致奖励稀疏\n\n**解决思路**:\n- 目标重标注 (HER)\n- 速度缩放拉开惯性窗口\n- 特权动作简化探索\n- 隐式课程学习","x":-320,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt_impedance","type":"text","text":"## 🎛️ 变阻抗控制\n\n**痛点**: 固定PD低频\"僵硬\"\n\n**解决思路**:\n- 刚度作为动作空间\n- 接触时低刚度顺从\n- 运动时高刚度精确\n- 末端空间参数化","x":10,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt_curriculum","type":"text","text":"## 📚 物理参数课程\n\n**痛点**: 直接学习高动态任务困难\n\n**解决思路**:\n- α-scaling 速度缩放\n- 从简单到复杂分布\n- 重力/摩擦渐进\n- Continuation Method","x":340,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt_sim2real","type":"text","text":"## 🌐 Sim-to-Real 迁移\n\n**痛点**: 动力学域差异\n\n**解决思路**:\n- Real-to-Sim-to-Real\n- 在线校正 (TRANSIC)\n- 数字孪生 RL 鲁棒化\n- 域随机化\n- 快速电机适应","x":670,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt_privileged","type":"text","text":"## 🔮 特权动作\n\n**痛点**: 物理边界阻碍探索\n\n**解决思路**:\n- 禁用碰撞\"穿透\"学习\n- 虚拟力辅助\n- 课程恢复物理约束\n- 从作弊到真实","x":1000,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt_representation","type":"text","text":"## 🧩 感知与表征\n\n**痛点**: 高维观测空间\n\n**解决思路**:\n- 视触觉融合\n- 扩散策略分布建模\n- 点云几何特征\n- 物理属性嵌入","x":1330,"y":250,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"paper_tarc","type":"text","text":"## TARC (2025)\n**时间自适应控制**\n\n💡 策略输出 (a, Δt)\n惯性阶段→低频\n接触切换→高频\n\n⭐ 直接解决频率困境","x":-650,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj_dnpm","type":"file","file":"Projects/Dynamic Non-Prehensile Manipulation/Dynamic Non-Prehensile Manipulation.md","subpath":"#1. 摘要","x":-150,"y":-350,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"proj_dnpm_insight","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 DNPM 核心洞见\n\n**惯性因果链条**:\n主动发力 → 高惯性状态 → 惯性力 → 对抗重力 → 物理演化\n\n**核心挑战**: 欠驱动系统的长程探索","x":300,"y":-350,"width":350,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"paper_pfqi","type":"text","text":"## Action Persistence (2020)\n**动作持续理论框架**\n\n💡 k-persistent MDP\n性能损失 ∝ 环境演化速度\n\n⭐ 频率选择的理论基础","x":-650,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_multifreq","type":"text","text":"## Multi-Frequency RL (2020)\n**多频率控制理论**\n\n💡 高层低频决策\n底层高频跟踪\n层次化频率分配\n\n⭐ 频率分离框架","x":-650,"y":1130,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"found_rl","type":"file","file":"Foundations/ReinforcementLearning.md","subpath":"#1. Core Concepts","x":-650,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_rl_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: 接触流形探索\n混合动力学系统\n隐式处理 f_ext","x":-650,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_control","type":"file","file":"Foundations/ControlTheory.md","subpath":"#3.2 解决方案 I：阻抗控制","x":-320,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_control_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: PID→CTC→阻抗控制\n力-位混合 · 时变刚度\n计算力矩理论基础","x":-320,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_dynamics","type":"file","file":"Foundations/Dynamics.md","x":10,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"paper_her","type":"text","text":"## HER (2017)\n**Hindsight Experience Replay**\n\n💡 失败→\"成功\"\n目标重标注\n隐式课程学习\n\n⭐ 稀疏奖励基石","x":-320,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_privileged","type":"text","text":"## Privileged Action (2025)\n**特权动作课程学习**\n\n💡 仿真中\"作弊\"\n禁用碰撞/虚拟力\n课程恢复约束\n\n⭐ 长时程探索突破","x":-320,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_vices","type":"text","text":"## VICES (2019)\n**末端空间变阻抗**\n\n💡 动作 = (Δx, K)\n位移 + 刚度\n任务相关顺从性\n\n⭐ 接触任务动作空间","x":10,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_facet","type":"text","text":"## FACET (2025)\n**阻抗参考模型跟踪**\n\n💡 RL 跟踪虚拟弹簧-质量-阻尼轨迹\n统一接口 (x_des, Kp, Kd)\n时变阻抗自然匹配相位\n\n⭐ DNPM 方向A核心方案","x":10,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_curriculum","type":"text","text":"## Curriculum Learning (2009)\n**课程学习理论**\n\n💡 Continuation Method\n简单→复杂分布\n避免局部极小\n\n⭐ α-scaling 理论背书","x":340,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_demostart","type":"text","text":"## DemoStart (2024)\n**演示引导自动课程**\n\n💡 从人类演示起始\n自动难度递增\n多指灵巧操作\n\n⭐ 课程+Sim2Real 融合","x":340,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_rialto","type":"text","text":"## RialTo (2024)\n**Real-to-Sim-to-Real**\n\n💡 数字孪生+RL鲁棒化\n逆向蒸馏\n67%+ 鲁棒性提升\n\n⭐ 迁移新范式","x":670,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_pen","type":"text","text":"## Pen Spinning (2024)\n**转笔三阶段Sim2Real**\n\n💡 Oracle + OpenLoop + Finetune\n<50条真实轨迹\nFinger Gaiting\n\n⭐ 动态操作典范","x":670,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_transic","type":"text","text":"## TRANSIC (2024)\n**在线校正迁移**\n\n💡 从在线人类校正学习\n残差策略\n无需额外仿真\n\n⭐ 迁移Gap动态修复","x":670,"y":1130,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_hora","type":"text","text":"## HORA (2022)\n**快速电机适应**\n\n💡 Rapid Motor Adaptation\n在线系统辨识\n隐式参数推断\n\n⭐ 零样本域适应","x":1000,"y":1130,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_longhorizon","type":"text","text":"## Long-Horizon (2025)\n**特权动作长时程**\n\n💡 Push-and-Grasp\nPivot Grasp\n行为自发涌现\n\n⭐ 无需手工子任务","x":1000,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"paper_elastic","type":"text","text":"## VTS-RL (2021)\n**弹性时间步**\n\n💡 时间缩放MDP\n动态调整Δt\n\n⭐ TARC前身","x":1000,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_evocontrol","type":"text","text":"## EvoControl (2023)\n**进化高频控制**\n\n💡 进化策略+高频\n连续控制突破\n\n⭐ 高频策略可能性","x":1330,"y":700,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"paper_rotateit","type":"text","text":"## RotateIt (2024)\n**视触觉旋转**\n\n💡 Vision + Touch融合\n通用物体旋转\n多模态表征\n\n⭐ 表征学习典范","x":1330,"y":920,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"found_dynamics_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: 多体动力学\n惯性项建模\n时标分离","x":10,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_contact","type":"file","file":"Foundations/ContactMechanics.md","x":340,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_contact_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: 摩擦锥约束\n接触切换\n力学交互","x":340,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_optim","type":"file","file":"Foundations/Optimization.md","x":670,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_optim_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: Continuation\niLQR/MPC\n非凸优化","x":670,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_signal","type":"file","file":"Foundations/SignalProcessing.md","x":1000,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_signal_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: 触觉感知\n状态估计\nKF→EKF→UKF→PF","x":1000,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_stochastic","type":"file","file":"Foundations/StochasticProcess.md","x":1330,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_stochastic_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: 扩散策略\n不确定性建模\nMPPI采样优化","x":1330,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_repr","type":"file","file":"Foundations/RepresentationLearning.md","x":1660,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_repr_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: PCA→AE→VAE→对比\n视触觉融合\n点云几何表征","x":1660,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"found_info","type":"file","file":"Foundations/InformationTheory.md","x":1990,"y":1500,"width":280,"height":150},
		{"id":"found_info_insight","type":"text","text":"**核心**: 率失真理论\n压缩-去噪对偶性\n信息瓶颈\n内在动机","x":1990,"y":1670,"width":280,"height":100},
		{"id":"insights_group","type":"group","x":-700,"y":-950,"width":2560,"height":440,"color":"3","label":"💡 Research Insights: 原创 Idea (痛点-理论-文献三角定位)"},
		{"id":"idea_001","type":"text","text":"## Idea-001 [P0]\n**Phase-Adaptive Impedance**\n\n💡 逐指时变阻抗 + 频率自适应\nsnap→高刚度 / spin→低刚度\n\n⭐ Stage 0: Kp Grid Search","x":-650,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_002","type":"text","text":"## Idea-002 [P0]\n**Autoregressive Exploration**\n\n💡 接触自适应 AR-p 探索噪声\n替代白噪声 → 时间相关探索\n\n⭐ Stage 0: β Grid Search","x":-320,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_007","type":"text","text":"## Idea-007 [P0]\n**Dual Orthogonal Curriculum**\n\n💡 α物理难度 × δ状态难度\nZVF 门控 + 成功状态初始化\n\n⭐ 直接嵌入 HDC 论文","x":10,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_006","type":"text","text":"## Idea-006 [P0→P1]\n**Adaptive Lipschitz Actor**\n\n💡 状态自适应 Lipschitz 约束\n稳相平滑 / 动态相锐利\n\n⭐ Stage 0: K Grid Search","x":340,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_003","type":"text","text":"## Idea-003 [P1]\n**Causal Mediator Reward**\n\n💡 物理中介变量\n因果 credit assignment\n\n⭐ 动力学感知奖励","x":670,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_004","type":"text","text":"## Idea-004 [P1]\n**Convex Safe Set**\n\n💡 成功经验凸包\n几何 Bootstrapping\n\n⭐ 高惯性状态引导","x":1000,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_005","type":"text","text":"## Idea-005 [P2]\n**Test-Time Contact Adapt**\n\n💡 在线接触参数辨识\n诊断性交互 + 策略适应\n\n⭐ 部署时在线校正","x":1330,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"idea_combo","type":"text","text":"## ⚡ 最强组合\n\n**DOC + CA-ARP + ALA**\n双轴课程 + 相关噪声 + 平滑策略\n三者完全正交，全部 P0\n\n→ 见 [[_InsightsIndex]]","x":1660,"y":-900,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"1"}
	],
